        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ye Guild Clerk!</i></strong> is a short 2.5D, interactive narrative game, where you play as a newly hired guild clerk in a world full of cute animal adventurers! Perfect for players who love character-driven stories, cute animals, and cozy medieval fantasy worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of cute animal adventurers, <strong>each with their own stories</strong> and quirks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have <strong>5 days to prove you're a good fit for the role!</strong>.. or suffer the consequences and get fired...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a guild clerk, you'll <strong>hand out quests, rewards and equipment!...</strong> But be wary:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter</strong>, each action you take shapes the outcomes and stories for each adventurer you run into... for better or for worse!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 40+ individual endings</strong> between all of the adventurers you can meet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your clerk booth</strong> with various customizations and decorations! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from <strong>3 different music tracks</strong> to listen to!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point &amp; Click Controls - Drag, Select, &amp; Camera Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD/Arrow Keys - Camera Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click/Space - Continue Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC - Pause/Settings Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please Note:</i><u><strong> </strong></u> <br><u><i>There is no current way to save your progress</i></u><i>. It is highly recommended to play in one sitting. The average playthrough can take from 35 - 50 minutes.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ye Guild Clerk!</i></strong> is a short 2.5D, interactive narrative game, where you play as a newly hired guild clerk in a world full of cute animal adventurers! Perfect for players who love character-driven stories, cute animals, and cozy medieval fantasy worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of cute animal adventurers, <strong>each with their own stories</strong> and quirks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have <strong>5 days to prove you're a good fit for the role!</strong>.. or suffer the consequences and get fired...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a guild clerk, you'll <strong>hand out quests, rewards and equipment!...</strong> But be wary:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter</strong>, each action you take shapes the outcomes and stories for each adventurer you run into... for better or for worse!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 40+ individual endings</strong> between all of the adventurers you can meet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your clerk booth</strong> with various customizations and decorations! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from <strong>3 different music tracks</strong> to listen to!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point &amp; Click Controls - Drag, Select, &amp; Camera Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD/Arrow Keys - Camera Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click/Space - Continue Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC - Pause/Settings Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please Note:</i><u><strong> </strong></u> <br><u><i>There is no current way to save your progress</i></u><i>. It is highly recommended to play in one sitting. The average playthrough can take from 35 - 50 minutes.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "The local Adventurer's Guild is hiring!... Not for adventurers, but for guild clerks! You play an important role in handing out quests, gold, and equipment as your actions shape the stories of these animal adventurers for better, or for worse..!",
